* **Note:** Use the documented PlantUML render command (`docker run ... plantuml docs/diagrams/domain_erd.puml -tpng`) or the local `plantuml.jar` referenced in `tools/` to validate syntax before handoff.
* **Warning:** Do not invent new column naming schemes; keep timestamps as `created_at`/`updated_at` (TIMESTAMPTZ) and monetary values as `NUMERIC(19,4)` per existing docs. Any deviations must be justified in comments or the ERD will be considered non-authoritative.
